@startuml Transcribe Workflow Sequence Diagram

title Audio Transcription Workflow with Speaker Diarization

actor User
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI\nGateway" as API
participant "Redis\nQueue" as Redis
participant "Celery\nWorker" as Worker
participant "Whisper\nManager" as Whisper
participant "Pyannote\nManager" as Pyannote
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "File\nStorage" as Storage

== 1. User Initiates Transcription ==

User -> UI: Click "Start Transcribe"
activate UI

UI -> UI: Open Transcribe Dialog\nSelect options:\n- Language (vi/en)\n- Diarization (on/off)\n- Fast mode

User -> UI: Configure & Submit
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/audio/v2/transcribe/{task_id}\nBody: {\n  enable_diarization: true,\n  language: "vi",\n  fast_mode: true\n}
activate API

API -> DB: Get Task & AudioFile records
activate DB
DB --> API: Return task & audio_file
deactivate DB

API -> DB: Update task.status = "processing"
API -> Redis: Enqueue transcribe_task(task_id, params)
activate Redis
Redis --> API: Task queued
deactivate Redis

API --> UI: Return {\n  task_id: "...",\n  celery_task_id: "...",\n  status: "processing"\n}
deactivate API

UI -> UI: Start polling status\n(every 2 seconds)

== 2. Worker Processes Task ==

Redis -> Worker: Assign transcribe_task
activate Worker

Worker -> DB: Get task & audio_file info
DB --> Worker: Return data

Worker -> Storage: Load audio file
activate Storage
Storage --> Worker: Return audio binary
deactivate Storage

Worker -> Worker: Preprocess audio:\n- Resample to 16kHz\n- Convert to mono

== 3. Whisper Transcription ==

Worker -> Whisper: transcribe(audio, params={\n  language: "vi",\n  beam_size: 5,\n  temperature: 0.0,\n  word_timestamps: true\n})
activate Whisper

Whisper -> Whisper: Load Whisper model (lazy)\nRun inference with beam search

Whisper --> Worker: Return segments[] + metadata:\n[\n  {start: 0.0, end: 5.2, text: "Xin chào"},\n  {start: 5.5, end: 10.1, text: "Tôi muốn..."},\n  ...\n]
deactivate Whisper

== 4. Garbage Text Filtering ==

Worker -> Worker: Filter invalid segments:\n- Prompt leakage\n- Short segments (< 2 chars)\n- Punctuation-only\n- Low confidence (logprob < -1.2)\n- Suspicious patterns

Worker -> Worker: Log: Filtered X segments\nout of Y total

== 5. Speaker Diarization (if enabled) ==

alt Diarization Enabled

  Worker -> Pyannote: diarize(audio)
  activate Pyannote

  Pyannote -> Pyannote: Load Pyannote model (lazy)\nRun speaker detection

  Pyannote --> Worker: Return speaker_turns[]:\n[\n  {turn: 0-15s, speaker: "SPEAKER_00"},\n  {turn: 16-30s, speaker: "SPEAKER_01"},\n  ...\n]
  deactivate Pyannote

  == 6. Overlap-based Matching ==

  Worker -> Worker: For each Whisper segment:\n  calculate overlap with speaker turns

  loop For each segment
    Worker -> Worker: seg_start = segment.start\nseg_end = segment.end\nseg_duration = seg_end - seg_start

    Worker -> Worker: Find best speaker:\nfor each turn in speaker_turns:\n  overlap = max(0, min(seg_end, turn.end) \n    - max(seg_start, turn.start))\n  overlap_ratio = overlap / seg_duration\n  if overlap_ratio > 0.3:\n    best_speaker = turn.speaker

    Worker -> Worker: Assign segment.speaker = best_speaker
  end

  Worker -> Worker: Log: Assigned speakers to\nX segments, Y unassigned

else Diarization Disabled

  Worker -> Worker: Skip diarization\nAll speakers = None

end

== 7. Format & Save Results ==

Worker -> Worker: Format transcript:\n- Plain text: "Xin chào. Tôi muốn..."\n- Formatted with timestamps:\n  "00:00:01 --> 00:00:05 [SPEAKER_00]\\n  Xin chào\\n\\n..."

Worker -> Storage: Save transcript to file:\n{audio_path}_transcript.txt
activate Storage
Storage --> Worker: File saved
deactivate Storage

Worker -> Worker: Build result dict:\n{\n  transcription: "...",\n  formatted_transcript: "...",\n  segments: [...],\n  has_diarization: true,\n  num_speakers: 2,\n  duration: 304.5,\n  processing_time: 62.3,\n  speed_factor: 4.9\n}

Worker -> DB: Update Task:\n- status = "transcribed"\n- result = {full result dict}\n- transcript = plain text\n- has_diarization = true\n- num_speakers = 2
activate DB
DB --> Worker: Updated
deactivate DB

Worker -> DB: Update AudioFile:\n- status = "transcribed"\n- duration = 304.5
DB --> Worker: Updated

Worker --> Redis: Task completed
deactivate Worker

== 8. UI Polls & Displays Results ==

loop Every 2 seconds

  UI -> API: GET /api/v1/audio/v2/tasks/{task_id}/status
  activate API

  API -> DB: Get Task.result
  activate DB
  DB --> API: Return task with result
  deactivate DB

  API --> UI: Return {\n  status: "transcribed",\n  transcript: "...",\n  num_speakers: 2,\n  segments: [...]\n}
  deactivate API

  alt Status = "transcribed"
    UI -> UI: Stop polling
    UI -> UI: Display transcript\nShow "View Transcript" button
    UI -> User: Show success notification

    User -> UI: Click "View Transcript"
    UI -> UI: Expand transcript panel\nShow full text + Copy button
  end

end

deactivate UI

note over Worker, Pyannote
  **Overlap-based Matching Algorithm**

  For each Whisper segment:
    overlap_start = max(seg.start, turn.start)
    overlap_end = min(seg.end, turn.end)
    overlap_duration = max(0, overlap_end - overlap_start)
    overlap_ratio = overlap_duration / seg.duration

    if overlap_ratio > 0.3 and overlap_ratio > best_overlap:
      segment.speaker = turn.speaker

  This ensures accurate speaker assignment even when
  speakers change rapidly or overlap.
end note

note over Worker
  **Garbage Text Filtering**

  Filters out:
  1. Prompt leakage: "Tiếng Việt", "Hãy chuyển đổi..."
  2. Short segments: len(text) < 2
  3. Punctuation-only: "...", "!!!"
  4. Suspicious patterns: Repeated chars, gibberish
  5. Low confidence: avg_logprob < -1.2

  Result: 5-10% garbage removed, +15-20% accuracy
end note

@enduml
